#: ../../learn/providers.rst:33
msgid "The adapter normalizes messages, tools, and events, not the capabilities of every model. Pick an endpoint and model that support your workflow. In particular, images, visible reasoning, hosted tools, and tool search are not available on every endpoint. This runtime does not expose a general ``response_format`` or structured-final-output setting; for validated data, use a typed tool or validate the final answer in your application."
msgstr "适配器负责统一消息、工具和事件，但不统一每个模型的能力。请选择与你的工作流相匹配的端点和模型。尤其是，图像、可见推理、托管工具和工具搜索并非在所有端点上可用。本运行时不提供通用的 ``response_format`` 或结构化最终输出设置；如果需要经过校验的数据，请使用带类型的工具，或在应用中校验最终答案。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:41
msgid "Configure your chosen provider"
msgstr "配置你选定的模型提供商"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:43
msgid "Read credentials and model names from your environment. Every tab creates a ``model`` you can pass to ``create_agent``; close it with ``await model.aclose()`` when finished. These snippets configure real services and are not offline examples."
msgstr "从环境变量中读取凭据和模型名称。每个标签页都会创建一个可传给 ``create_agent`` 的 ``model``；使用完毕后用 ``await model.aclose()`` 关闭它。这些代码片段配置的是真实服务，并非离线示例。"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst
msgid "OpenAI"
msgstr "OpenAI"

#: ../../learn/providers.rst:63
msgid "``response=True`` selects the Responses API. Omit it for Chat Completions (the default). Choose a protocol supported by your endpoint; enabling this flag does not add Responses support to a gateway."
msgstr "``response=True`` 会选择 Responses API。省略它则使用 Chat Completions（默认）。请选择端点支持的协议；启用这个标志并不会给网关增加 Responses 支持。"

